# PP5CI Hotspot - RSSI mapping for MMDVM_HS / ADF7021
# The MMDVM_HS firmware used by this project reports the RSSI magnitude.
# MMDVMHost maps that value to negative dBm through RSSIMappingFile.
#
# Raw RSSI    dBm
43   -43
53   -53
63   -63
73   -73
83   -83
93   -93
99   -99
105  -105
111  -111
117  -117
123  -123
129  -129
135  -135
141  -141
